    <!--
    The camera is opened by the scanner helper, never by this process. The
    usage string still has to be here: TCC attributes a child's request to the
    responsible process, which is this app, and refuses outright rather than
    prompting when the responsible process cannot say what the camera is for.
  -->
  <key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
  <string>Keep Vault liest den QR-Code eines gedruckten Schlüsselzettels, damit der 512-Bit-Faktor nicht von Hand eingetippt werden muss. Das Kamerabild wird nur währenddessen ausgewertet und nirgends gespeichert.</string>
